# Closed options in src/fix/SPEC.md that must SURVIVE a later edit. Read by
# `mth check --records src/fix/.spec-records src/fix/SPEC.md` (hk step
# `mth-check`); format and rationale as in the root `.spec-records`.

# A preset for emoji SEQUENCES. Without this, a later reader proposes it --
# it reads like the obvious twin of `emoji` -- and nothing would say it was
# tried: a set holds code points, and a sequence is not one.
V31  `emoji-seq` preset REJECTED

# A `--words` switch. Without this, a later reader adds one for
# convenience; the map line `use words` already is the switch, and a
# second one is a second place for the two to disagree.
V51  `--words` flag REJECTED
